{
 "id": "long03",
 "show": "FULL CLEAR",
 "label": "GUIDE",
 "title": "11 secret weapons & cars you can get EARLY",
 "episode": "Early game guide \u00b7 Nov 2026",
 "cast": {
  "Mei": {}
 },
 "lines": [
  [
   "Mei",
   "Mei here."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Most players run past the best stuff in GTA Six."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Today: eleven secret weapons and cars you can grab early."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "No glitches, no story spoilers."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Just where to go and what to watch out for."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number one: a free silenced pistol."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "On the southern shore of the easternmost Permit Keys island, there's a wrecked spy boat on the beach."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Climb on, open the hatch in the middle, and take the Assassin Nipper."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "It's suppressed, so it's perfect for quiet jobs."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number two is missable. Donnie's revolver."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Late in chapter one, you're told to get rid of a car."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Before you do, open the trunk."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "The revolver is inside."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "If you destroy the car first, it's gone."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "And if you ever lose a unique weapon, check the lockers at a weapon shop."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number three: a legendary sniper, guarded by a tiger."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "East of Pelican Valley, near a small airstrip, follow the gunshots."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "A tiger is attacking the people at a run-down camp."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Let the fight end."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Then loot a few thousand in cash, and the sniper in the next room."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "More men can show up, so be ready, and leave before the police do."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number four: a hidden bunker."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Inside a trailer on private land, there's a hatch down to a bunker."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Down there: a rocket launcher and a legendary submachine gun."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "This early, that's ridiculous."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number five: a tower near the start of the game. Climb it."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "On the way up you'll find a playing card, a sniper rifle on the balcony, and at the very top, a parachute."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Keep that parachute for later."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Now the cars."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number six: the green Fast and Furious sports car."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "It sits in a double garage in central Vice City."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "The alarm goes off, but it stops by itself."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Just know it won't stay yours until you can register it with Moses, and that costs about six and a half thousand."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number seven: a hot rod in a shipping container."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "At a rail yard, use the bulldozer to push the other containers away, then cut the locked one open with the grinder."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Inside is the Caliente Picador."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number eight: Randy's wish list. Four cars."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "The Infernus is on level seven of the Crosstown police car park."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "The Vitello is in a villa garage in Waning Sands."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "The Banshee waits outside the Sweetbay Inn in Capri, around three in the morning."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "And the Gauntlet Hellfire is behind the junkyard in Hamlet. Number nine: Moses' drop-offs. Deliver all seven and he gives you his Emperor Sultan."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Two to start with: a Futo in the postal depot on Draper Island, and a Nightblade at the biker clubhouse in Ambrosia."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number ten: Wyman's classic cars, if you have the Special or Ultimate Edition."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Find and scan fifteen parts, pay fifteen hundred a car, and after four builds, the fifth one comes with a jacket."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Number eleven: get in the air early."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "There's a Maverick helicopter near Key Lento, and there are fifteen airstrips and helipads with planes and choppers."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Now, the catch."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Early on you can only hotwire cheap cars."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Better cars have trackers, and the supercars are only yours around the middle of the story."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "So enjoy the joyride, but don't get attached yet."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "And one more tip: money you hide under your first bedroom floor can get lost later."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Bank it instead."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Every spot from this video is pinned on our free map at fullclear map dot com."
  ],
  [
   "Mei",
   "Mei, out."
  ]
 ],
